<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">2TIPOK.SFK 25-05-2,007. ADELINA QUEJ POKOMCHI Updated for DBL by G. Grasso and E. Canales, Dec 2012, standardization after migration to PT8 by A. Camus March, 2019.</book>
  <para style="h">2 TIMOTEO</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tim</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tim</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 TIMOTEO</para>
  <para style="mt2">RE' I RUKAB' RUHUUJ I TIMOTEO</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 TIMOTEO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Taaq'anik rusuqkiil k'uxliis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' hin i Pablo, hin raj tahqaneel i Jesucristo. Eh xchalik paruk'ux i Dios chi xirutaq'aaj chuq'orariik i ruyejaam cho wach, re' i k'acharik i ruyeew i Jesucristo. <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' hin inutz'ihb'aaj reje aweh i huuj wili, Timoteo, hat wak'uun noq wilkaat q'e' tinuk'ax. Re' ta naq i Ajaab'ees Dios, i QaJaaw Jesucristo neen kiyeew aweh i kotob'il, i ketelinik wachiis, i suq kiil k'uxliis.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' ruq'orariik i korik chiriij i Jesucristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' hin eliik tik'ulik panuk'ux panutiij chi q'iij chi aq'ab'. Tinut'iosej ree Dios, re' i k'ahchi' nub'anam i rukamaj i hin chi ma' xta ruch'uwa'iil wach i nukapeew, je' rukab' i rukamaj i Dios xkian chaloq i numaam wati't. <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' hin eliik ink'ulik cho panuk'ux oq'ik a'nam chaloq ruum i ruti'kiil ak'ux. Eh xa nwaaj naq chik wilom awach, reh chi q'e' neensuuqb'ik nuk'ux. <verse number="5" style="v" />Ink'ulik cho panuk'ux chi re' hat korik wach ak'ux chi nimanik, je' rukab' i nimanik xub'an cho pampeet aak'een, qatuu Loida, ruch'ihil atuut Eunice. Re' hin ch'iklik nuk'ux chi ko je' wo' re' i nimanik k'ahchi' kaat i hat yu'naak.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' hin i nuq'or aweh chi kamanoq aweh akooch xuyeew i Dios noq xnuyeew i nuq'ab' cha naah reh apa'ab'jiik, <verse number="7" style="v" />ruum re' Ruxlab'al xuyeew cho qeh i Dios ma' re' ta yo'jik i ruk'am chaloq i ruyeew la' rukowiil qak'ux reh i k'axaj iib', reh i rukorkiil wach qak'ux. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh mat k'ixik chuq'orariik i rib'iral i QaJaaw Jesucristo. Mat k'ixik wo' wuum i hin chi wilkiin prexo ruum i rukamaj i reh. Hat-oq la' haa' chuk'ulariik i ti' k'axik ruum i ruq'orariik i ak' k'uhb'aal. Chakuy ransil taqe re', ruuk' i rajaawriik i Dios. <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' reh xko'linik qeh, eh xusik' cho qawach reh i santohiil, ma' ruum ta chi chib'ih ta jariik i holohik laj qa'nam, xa ruum la' chi je' re' i xuyejaa' cho wach, eh xa ruum chi xoj ruk'ax. Re' Dios xanoq wo' xojruk'ax parub'ihnaal i Jesucristo noq komajaa' i rutz'uhkrisaj chaloq i wach ak'al. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh yu'naak, xk'utinik chik i ruk'axb'al ruuk' i ruk'uliik i qaj Ko'loom Jesucristo, re' i xsachwik wach i rajaawriik i kimik. Eh ruuk' i ruq'orariik rib'iral i k'uhb'aal ree ko'lemb'al iib', xuteh wach jinaj i ak' k'acharik ma' sahchik ta wach reh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' Dios xpaab'anik cho weh chi naa nuq'orom rib'iral i k'uhb'aal wili, eh xirupab'aa' chaloq chi hin raj tahqaneel, eh chi hin aj k'uhb'alineel. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ruum aj i re', k'ahchi' nuk'ulum i ti' k'axik wili. Xa re' la' re' hin ma' kink'ixik taj ruum taqe re', ruum weht'al awach i nunimaj, eh i nunimaj chi wilik rajaawriik chi rumolariik i nuye'aab' naa ruye'em weh na' k'oloq ruka'peech i Jesucristo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Je' re' noq maakanaa' chik i xti korik laj tijinik xponik nuk'uhtaaj aweh. Eh tinimanoq, tik'axwoq je' rukab' iraaj i Jesucristo. <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh ruuk' i rajaawriik i Santolaj Uxlab'al wilik pan qánima, chako'leej riij i korik laj k'uhb'aal ruye'em chaaweh i Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' hat aweht'al chik chi re' taqe aj nimaneel wilkeeb' ar Asia xinkikanaa' chi wutkeel, re' haa' Figelo ruch'ihil i Hermógenes. <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' ta naq i QaJaaw neen ketelinik kiwach taqe i awach reh parupaat i Onesíforo, ruum re' reh k'ih pech xk'ulik ruyeew rusuqkiil nuk'ux. Eh ma' xk'ixik ta wuum chi wilkiin chi prexohjik. <verse number="17" style="v" />Xa noq la' wo' xintohq'ik rusik'im noq xponik pan tinamit Roma korehtaal xirureq. <verse number="18" style="v" />Re' hat aweht'al chik nik' wach i qatoob'jiik xub'an chaloq ar Éfeso. Neeta naq inketeeljik wach ruum i QaJaaw na' chureq ruq'ijil i ruk'uliik ruka'peech i Jesucristo.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Hat-oq manlik ru soldado i Jesucristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' hat Timoteo, i hat wak'uun noq wilkaat, chakowej ak'ux ruuk' i rotob'il i Jesucristo ruye'em aweh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh re' i xab'iraj, re' i xnuq'or chikiwach i ruk'ihaal, re' wo' chik i re' cha k'uhtaaj keh taqe i korik wach kik'ux, re' taqe i nee wo' inki a'n ruk'uhtjiik xa awach aj eh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Je' re' noq, hat-oq haa' chukuyariik ransil i ti' k'axik. Hat-oq manlik ru soldado i Jesucristo. <verse number="4" style="v" />Chakoj rehtaal chi ma' jino'q i manlik soldado wilik chi cha'jinik neerub'an i tokoom kamanik. Re' wilik chi soldado hiil xa re' wo' naa rub'anam imponik chuwach intaaq'anik reh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Je' wo' re' inokik haa' chi pajaj ajiim wila' ma' xuchop ruk'ux chi rub'anariik i tijimaj wii', ma' jaruuj naaruye'ariik reh i ru korona. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh chawil i aj ab'ixoom kopeet naarukamaneem wach kora'j naarunik'eem re' i wach i rutik.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chakapaaj riij taqe i nuq'or reje aweh, eh re' QaJaaw neentoob'inik aweh reh chi chu'nchel neenareq chiriij.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mansahchik panak'ux i xk'ulik rub'an i Jesucristo, re' xwukteesjik chaloq chi k'achlik wach, eh re' ruuk' chaloq i riih rumaam i reey David. Re' wili i ak' k'uhb'aal k'ahchi' nuq'orom rib'iral i hin.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ruum i ruq'orariik rib'iral i k'uhb'aal wili, k'ahchi' nukuyum ransil i ti' k'axik. Xa je' chik hin runimaal aj mahk inki a'n weh, hin kib'ak'am chi karena. Xa re' la' re' i ruk'uhb'aal i Dios reh, ma' b'ak'lik ta wach chi karena. <verse number="10" style="v" />Ruum i re', k'ahchi' nukuyum ransil chu'nchel i ti' k'axik, reh i kitoob'jiik i sik'ooj cho kiwach ruum i Dios, reh chi neenkireq i loq'laj ko'lemb'al iib' reh i juneliik, re' i ruyeew qeh i Jesucristo.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' q'orik wili xti korik:</para>
  <para style="q">Wila' xoj-ehtrik haa' i rukimiik i Jesucristo,</para>
  <para style="q">naa wo' chik ruwihiik qak'achariik ruuk' i reh chi juneliik.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh wila' xqakuy i ti' k'axik, naaqehtriik haa' i runimaal rajaawriik.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh wila' xqaq'or chi ma' qeht'al ta wach,</para>
  <para style="q">naa wo' ruq'orom i reh chi ma' reht'al ta qawach i hoj.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Atoob' ta ma' korik wach qak'ux i hoj,</para>
  <para style="q">re' reh xa korik wo' wach ruk'ux, ruum ma' nee ta rujal wach i ruq'orom chaloq.</para>
  <para style="s">Jinaj aj kamanoom korik wach ruk'ux</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuwach i Dios i nuq'or aweh chi chawik'saj ruq'orariik pan kixikin, eh chak'uhb'alej taqe chi mankiwech'uj chik kiib' chiriij i k'utaaj xama' xta rub'ehel. Ruum re' taqe re', xa yojb'al kik'ux taqe ki-ib'irinik reh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh xti cha chop ak'ux chi korik chi neenak'uhtaaj chuwach i Dios chi hat atoob'laj raj kamanoom, eh mo'-oq chih k'isinoq neetik'ixik wii'. Chach'ob' la' rub'ehel chi manlik i korik laj k'uhb'aal. <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' hat, maamin awiib' ruuk' i yeb'ee wach k'utaaj iraaj ma' raaj q'orarik, ruum re' kiq'orik reh taqe re', xa reh reh kiq'eb'em kiib' panti' k'axik. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh re' yiib' wach na'ojb'al inkik'uhtaaj inooj chunimaal, je' rukab' i rub'an i rax q'aah i ruk'ux reje riib'. Re' i na'ojb'al re' re' k'ahchi' ruk'uhtaam i winaq, Himeneo, ruch'ihil i Fileto. <verse number="18" style="v" />Re' keh xkikanaa' i korik laj nimanik, eh k'ahchi' kiq'orom chi re' taqe kamnaq wuktinaq chik taqe chaloq. Ruum i inkiq'or re' re', wilik taqe k'ahchi' kiyojom ruk'ux chi nimanik. <verse number="19" style="v" />Raaj i Dios reh jinaj i kowlaj ch'ikaab' reh rukojom, re' i wilik chi juneliik, re' i tz'ihb'amaj wii' rehtalil chi je' wili: Re' QaJaaw reht'al kiwach taqe i rak'uun rixq'uun, eh chu'nchel i kiq'orik rib'iral i QaJaaw, inchol kikanaam i yiib' wach na'ojb'al, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chupaam jino'q i nimlaj paat ma' xata re' oro oon plata kiyej-aal i kulk wilkeeb' ar. Wilik la' wo' taqe i chee' eh ak'al kiyej-aal. Eh wilik i looq' kikamanik wii'. Eh wilik i xama' looq' ta kikamanik wii'. <verse number="21" style="v" />Awach iraaj chi looq' naa rukamaniik wii', chuwach i QaJaaw ruq'asam riib' reh chi manlik. Inchol chi xa eliik-oq saq wach i ránima, eh marutz'a'j chik ruuk' i yiib' wach na'ojb'al. Chi je' re', xa re' chik i holohik chi b'anarik neerub'an.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' hat, maa a'n aweh i mahk inki a'n taqe k'ijolaq. Re' la' korik cha a'n panak'achariik tinimanoq tik'axwoq xa suq-oq ak'ux kuuk' taqe i saq wach i kánima chuq'orariik rib'iral i QaJaaw. <verse number="23" style="v" />Maatijej aweh i xa memil laj wech'inik iib' ma' xta rub'ehel. Re' hat aweht'al chik chi re' taqe re' xa yojoj k'uxliis i ruk'am chaloq. <verse number="24" style="v" />Re' jino'q i raj kamanoom i QaJaaw ma' ruk'ul ta chi sik'il peleto, xa chu'nchel-oq la' aj uuk' chaq'laam. Eh choloq k'uhb'alinik, xa kuyuul-oq, <verse number="25" style="v" />eh xa ch'ub'ik-oq wach ruk'ux chi kik'uhb'aljiik i ja'lik kichii' kiwach. Chi je' re', nee oon naq injalarik wach i kina'ojb'al ruum i Dios, reh chi neenkinimaj i reh. Eh nee oon naq inkireq chiriij i korik, <verse number="26" style="v" />reh chinee na'lojik cho keh, eh neenkiq'uch cho kiib' paruxirob' i aj Yahm, re' taqe i ruminim wii', reh chi neerub'an kuuk' iraaj i reh.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' naa kianam i tinamit pantz'apaab' poo wach ree q'iij</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' hat inchol anab'eem chi pantz'apaab' taqe poo wach ree q'iij xa reh reh wach i ti' k'axik naarilariik: <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' tinamit xa re' keh naakik'axam kiib', naakik'axam wach i tumiin, naakinimb'isam kiwach, xama' tiklik ta naa kib'aniik. Eh ma' holohik ta naa kiq'oriik chiriij i Dios, ma' naa ta kinimam i kituut kajaaw ma' xtaj naakit'iosem, ni xata naakinimam i korik. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh ma' naa ta ruwihiik i k'axooj kuuk', ni xata ketelinik wachiis, xa re' chik i tz'aqaj wach k'utaaj naa kianam, eh ma' naa ta kikanaam rub'aan i re' ma' re' xiik' naah kijosq'iil, eh naakixowaam wach chu'nchel i holohik. <verse number="4" style="v" />Naa kianam i jot'ooj chi ma' eht'alimaj, naa rub'anam xa teheeh kiwach, naakinimb'isam kiib' chub'aan i xama' xta rutiq wach, ma' naa ta kinimam i Dios, xa re' naakisik'im i ruk'ax wach i kiti'jolal. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh xa je' tii chik manlik aj nimaneel naa kianam kiib', xa re' la' ma' naa ta ruponiik panaq'kiwach i korik laj nimanik. Re' hat, maamin awiib' kuuk' i je' re' kina'ojb'al.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ruum re' taqe re' xa kiooj chi' taq paat chi kijot'ariik taqe meem laj ixoq, i xiik' naah i kimahk, i kiq'eb'em kiib' chub'anariik i xa chib'ih jariik i ruk'ax wach i kiti'jolal. <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' taqe i kib'anik reh i je' re' juneliik wo' naq k'ahchi' kitijem kiib' xa re' la' ma' jaruuj ta wo' naa kireqem chiriij i korik. <verse number="8" style="v" />Nik' wach i xkian chaloq i winaq aj war, Janes, i Jambres, i xkixowaaj cho wach i xub'an i Moisés, je' wo' re' inki a'n taqe aj jot'ool re' re' inkixowaaj wach i korik eh xiik' naah yib'kiil wach i kikapeew kiq'eb'em chiriij kik'ux i korik laj nimanik. <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' keh ma' naa ta rojiik eloq wach i naa kianam, ruum chu'nchel i tinamit naa kikojom rehtaal chi xa sahcheel i kina'ojb'al, je' rukab' i xkik'ul i ki'ib' chi winaq i xi-ixowanik cho wach i xub'an i Moisés.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh re' hat, xatijej chik aweh i k'uhb'alinik i nub'an i hin, i nuna'ojb'al, i chib'ih inwaaj chiriij, i nimanik i nub'an, je' wo' hoq i kuyuuj, i k'axooj i nub'an, je' wo' hoq i rukowiil nuk'ux, <verse number="11" style="v" />i ti' k'axik ruch'ihil ixowaal. Re' hat aweht'al chik chu'nchel chib'ih jariik i xnuk'ul cho Antioquía, Iconio, Listra. Eh chu'nchel i ti' k'axik xnuk'ul cho ar ruum ixowaal, re' QaJaaw x-esanik weh chupaam. <verse number="12" style="v" />Xti korik noq awach inkaaj k'acharik chi kiq'asam kiib' ree Jesucristo, naa wo' kik'iik chi ti' k'axik i keh ruum ixowaal. <verse number="13" style="v" />Raaj taqe i yiib' wach i kina'ojb'al ruch'ihil taqe jot'ool, xa reh reh kiq'eb'em kiib' chi re' chi ma' re', eh tokoom chik naa rujot'wiik kekeh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh re' hat, maakanaa' chik rub'aan i xatijej, re' i xareq chik chiriij chi re' re' i korik. Re' hat aweht'al chik awach taqe xitijinik chaaweh. <verse number="15" style="v" />K'oloq panak'ux chi kopan ak'isinal xatoq'aa' cho reht'aljiik chib'ih i ruq'or pan santo laj huuj, re' inkojwik ana'ojb'al, eh tiruko'leej ruuk' i runimjiik i Jesucristo. <verse number="16" style="v" />Chu'nchel i tz'ihb'amaj pan santo laj huuj re' i Dios xye'wik chaloq ruuk' i Ruxlab'al. Inkamanik reh k'uhb'alinik, reh q'ilooj, reh loch'oj nahis, reh kojooj na'ojb'al, reh chi neenb'aan i k'acharik parukorkiil, <verse number="17" style="v" />reh chi re' i nimanik ree Dios naaruwihiik runa'ojb'al, eh chi naa ruyejaam riib' chi korik chub'anariik chu'nchel i holohik chi b'anarik.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Timoteo, cha kuy i nuq'or aweh chuwach i Dios, eh chuwach i QaJaaw Jesucristo, re' i naa ruchaliik chi Reey chi q'ataj q'orik chikinaah i k'achalkeeb', chikinaah kamnaq, <verse number="2" style="v" />chi chayeew ak'ux chuq'orariik i ruk'uhb'aal i Dios. Atoob' ta ruyee riib', atoob' ta naq ma' ruyee riib' chawach. Tikojwoq na'ojb'al, tiq'ilwoq, tiye'woq rukowiil k'uxliis, eh tik'uhb'alinoq ruuk' kuyuuj, <verse number="3" style="v" />ruum naaruponiik i q'iij chi re' tinamit ch'i'k chik naa kib'iram i korik laj tijinik. Xa naa kianam kina'ojb'al kiib', naakisik'im k'ih-oq kaj tijoom naaruk'uhtjiik keh aha' wilik i naa kaajwaam rib'irjiik. <verse number="4" style="v" />Naakiq'eb'em chiriij kik'ux rib'irjiik i korik eh re' chik naaruponiik chikiwach rib'irjiik i xama' xta rub'ehel laj k'utaaj. <verse number="5" style="v" />Raaj i hat, wilik-oq ana'ojb'al chub'anariik i korik. Chakuy ransil i ti' k'axik. Maacanaa' chik ruq'orariik rib'iral i ak' k'uhb'aal reh i ko'lemb'al iib'. Cha a'n chi korik aakamaj.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' hin ilook' kinkanteesjik chi je' hin jilow mayiij ach k'isiin ma' rureq ruq'ijil i nukimiik. <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' hin xnuyeew cho nuk'ux chuko'ljiik riij i korik laj nimanik. Eh korehtaal xnukohlaaj wach inutoq'aam cho ruuk', ma' jaruuj xyoj nuk'ux chi nimanik. <verse number="8" style="v" />Yu'naak aj re' k'ahchi' kiin ruy-eem jinaj i nukorona chiriij i xnub'an, re' i naa ruye'em weh pan jinaj q'iij i QaJaaw, re' i Q'atal Q'orik korik wach ruk'ux. Eh ma' xata re' hin naa ruye'em weh i korona naa la' wo' ruye'em keh i k'ahchi' kuy-eem chu'nchel kik'ux i ruk'uliik ruka'peech.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' rukojariik runa'ojb'al xb'aan reje i Timoteo ruum i Pablo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chachop chak'ux chi chalik chi jumehq'iil, reh chi nee kink'ulik aq'o'reej. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh re' Demas xiruq'eb' kahnoq, xooj Tesalónica, ruum q'e' xponik chuwach i xa chib'ih jariik wilik ayu' wach ak'al. Re' Crescente reh xooj Galacia, eh re' Tito reh xooj Dalmacia. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ach wo' re' Lucas xkahnik wuuk' ayu'. Chasik' chaloq i Marcos. Neenak'am cho chawiij, ruum re' reh neerub'an nutoob'jiik chub'aan i rukamaj i Dios. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh re' Tíquico reh xnutaq'aaj reje Éfeso. <verse number="13" style="v" />Na' ti chaloq, i k'oq chak'am weh i nukápa nukanaam cho parupaat i Carpo ar Troas. Chak'am wo' cho weh taqe nuhuuj. Eh xti nwaaj wo' chi nee nak'am cho weh taqe i nutz'uhuum nutz'ihb'aam kiwach.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' Alejandro, i aj ch'eyel ch'ihch', ma' k'isiin taqe nujot'ariik rub'anam re' QaJaaw Jesucristo naaruq'ajwiik wach reh i xub'an re' re'. <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' hat, chawik'raaj awiib' chuwach i winaq re' re', ruum re' reh i rixowaaj wach i ak' k'uhb'aal inqaq'or rib'iral.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' hin, noq xnuko'leej wiib' pampeet chikiwach i q'atal q'orik, ma' jino'q xtoob'inik weh chi kunchelaal i wuch'ihil xinkikanaa' chi wutkeel. Re' xkian re' re', ma' ta naq neenkanab'jik wach kinaah ruum i Dios. <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' QaJaaw ra'j xirutoob'eej re', xuyeew rukowiil nuk'ux, chuq'orariik i ak' k'uhb'aal, reh chi xkib'iraj i ma' re' ta taqe aj judío. Eh re' QaJaaw xko'linik weh chuwach i je' josq'laj kaq b'ahlam. <verse number="18" style="v" />Re' wo' reh naaruko'liniik weh chuwach taqe i yiib' wach na'ojb'al neenkian weh, eh naa wo' kirucha'jeem korehtaal kiruk'am johtoq ruuk' pa runimaal rajaawriik ar pan taxaaj. Re' ta wo' naq i QaJaaw ye'aroq ruloq'il chi juneliik Je' ta wo' naq re'.</para>
  <para style="s">Taaq'anik suq kiil k'uxliis rupahqaljiik rotob'il i Dios xkuxik wii' wach rutz'ihb'jiik i huuj wili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chayeew tii rusuqkiil ruk'ux weh i, Priscila, ruch'ihil i rub'ahiil, Aquila rub'ihnaal, je' wo' taqe i awach reh i Onesíforo. <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' Erasto reh xkahnik cho ar Corinto. Eh re' Trófimo reh xnukanaa' cho ar Mileto ruum yowaab'. <verse number="21" style="v" />Eh cha chop chak'ux chi chalik chi komajaa' ruq'ijil i jab'. Re' i Eubulo i rutaq'aaj reje rusuqkiil ak'ux, ruch'ihil i Pudente, je' wo' hoq i lino, je' wo' hoq i Claudia, je' wo' chu'nchel taqe hermano.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Re' ta naq i QaJaaw Jesucristo wih-oq panawánima. Eh re' ta naq i rotob'il i Dios nee ruyeew taq cha naah kuuk' chu'nchel i hermano wilkeeb' ar. Je' ta wo' naq re'.</para>
</usx>